{"pull": {"id": "number:19705", "number": 19705, "title": "KAFKA-19245: Updated default locks config for share group", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-05-13T09:45:57Z", "closed_at": "2025-05-13T12:46:25Z", "merged_at": "2025-05-13T12:46:25Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Updated default locks config for share groups from 200 to 2000. The\nincrease in the limit is a result from tests which showed that with\ndefault maxFetchRecords of 500 from client and 200 as locks limit, there\ncan't be parallel fetch for same partition. Also the tests resulted that\nsharing a partition to an index of 3-4 is easily achievable, hence\nraised the limit to 4 times of default limit of maxFetchRecords (500).\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>\n", "labels": [{"id": 6979675393, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABoAVlAQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/KIP-932", "name": "KIP-932", "color": "DA462F", "default": false, "description": "Queues for Kafka", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19705"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}